  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.0.100\n\n## Changes (initial history)\n\n- AR-5.1: Extend Game Boy camera state to Y (`8ca849c`)\n- AR-4.3: Migrate Game Boy runner to camera_set_position (`ebe6155`)\n- AR-4.2: Reuse Game Boy camera movement for camera_set_position (`da1eb80`)\n- AR-4.1: Add camera_set_position SDK boundary (`9d1a707`)\n- AR-3.4: Generate Game Boy collision flags from world map (`0169e34`)\n- AR-3.3: Generate Game Boy streaming data from world map (`4c97f7b`)\n- AR-3.2: Generate initial Game Boy map from world data (`151033c`)\n- AR-3.1: Define portable world map structures (`96fd91c`)\n- AR-2.3: Lower WaitFrame through the Game Boy SDK path (`67e3931`)\n- AR-2.2: Add an operation creation boundary (`b7985ba`)\n- AR-2.1: Add SDK operation records (`4bef363`)\n- AR-1.4: Add capability error formatting (`64d990e`)\n- AR-1.3: Add NES capabilities (`5ffac53`)\n- AR-1.2: Add Game Boy capabilities (`0d2e00d`)\n- AR-1.1: Add capability model types (`ec05abd`)\n- docs: add autonomous roadmap execution workflow (`e9a860f`)\n- fix: improve game boy runner camera collision (`97537c5`)\n- feat: support helper functions in console samples (`d9b7166`)\n- fix: improve game boy sample gameplay (`4218e8d`)\n- chore: migrate solution to .NET 10 (`420a09b`)\n- fix: settle game boy joypad reads (`6fa2c19`)\n- feat: improve game boy runner controls and sprites (`90f2a96`)\n- docs: prioritize playable runner gaps (`eda3671`)\n- docs: record game boy runner roadmap (`2316290`)\n- feat: add game boy jump input (`80d4747`)\n- feat: add game boy map collision (`4e06dab`)\n- feat: add mario runner animation (`d583c30`)\n- feat: add game boy png sprite assets (`530cbed`)\n- chore: update z80dotnet submodule (`c370073`)\n- feat: add playable game boy rom target (`84264a2`)\n- Align SemanticAnalysis to canonical types and print correct function return types (#26) (`48163fc`)\n- Adopt canonical types throughout (i16/void), align grammar and tests; rename leftover SomeCompiler profile to RetroSharp; re-enable semantic sample suite with updated snapshots (#25) (`c86e19f`)\n- chore: Enable recursive submodule checkout in Azure Pipelines configuration (`827f51e`)\n- chore: Simplify Azure Pipelines configuration and update NuGet publishing steps (`3568f00`)\n- feat: Rename project from SomeCompiler to RetroSharp and add CI/CD pipeline (#24) (`3c23aea`)\n- chore(submodules): update 6502DotNet and Z80DotNet to latest on master (`adcbc90`)\n- Ignore JetBrains Rider user-specific files (.sln.DotSettings.user, .ipr, .iws) (`3b1ebeb`)\n- feat: Update Z80DotNet submodule ref after enhancing NuGet metadata (`3f33dba`)\n- feat: Update 6502DotNet submodule ref after converting to .NET Tool (`eea2a1d`)\n- refactor: Update 6502DotNet submodule ref after csproj modernization (`0e5b942`)\n- fix: Update 6502DotNet submodule ref after fixing CLI compilation (`aa94166`)\n- chore: Update submodule refs to include NuGet packaging setup (`27694da`)\n- Update 6502.Net submodule to upstream sync (Shared API) (#22) (`b077626`)\n- Update submodule libs/6502DotNet to sync/upstream-20250912 (`ce3d404`)\n- Enable Central Package Management, NuGet source mapping, and cleanup (#21) (`66f6bce`)\n- Restructure repo: move submodules to libs/, code to src/, update references and docs (`d1f14c7`)\n- CLI: assemble with Sixty502DotNet and run on Z80 emulator; print HL result (`2faa200`)\n- IR optimizations: add BranchFolding and StrengthReduction transforms; chain into pipeline (`05d597f`)\n- Add IR PrettyPrinterVisitor; implement CopyPropagation and DeadCodeElimination transforms; wire into pipeline; use printer in CLI (#20) (`dc6da26`)\n- Remove legacy IR (root) and VirtualMachine projects; migrate Fragment to Model IR; drop legacy tests; fix solution (#19) (`99f7c7d`)\n",
